## Data

Line data © the respective Operators; redistributed for reference. The ETUSA Line attributes derived from French Wikipedia are CC BY-SA 4.0, and the shapes, Directions, Stations and memberships derived from OpenStreetMap are ODbL 1.0, © OpenStreetMap contributors. Per-part attribution is in LICENSE and NOTICE.

In detail:

ETUSA Line attributes come from French Wikipedia under CC BY-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/. Shapes, Directions, Stations, and memberships come from a reviewed OpenStreetMap snapshot under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0, https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/, with attribution © OpenStreetMap contributors.

ETUS Tiaret, ETUSTO, ETUS Béjaïa, ETUS M'Sila, ETUS Sidi Bel Abbès, ETUS Setif, ETUS Aïn Defla, ETUS Annaba, ETUS Tlemcen, ETO Oran, ETUS Oum El Bouaghi, ETUS-C Constantine, ETUS Skikda, and ETUL Laghouat Line facts come from official Operator pages, APIs, programs, and maps. Those source materials do not state an open reuse licence, so no open licence is claimed over them: all rights in the source materials remain with their respective Operators, and their inclusion as factual reference data grants no rights beyond applicable law.

Data licences and attribution requirements are detailed in NOTICE.
